e=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8181bcdfbad8d73a\" href=\"?note=8181bcdfbad8d73a\" title=\"93-df-valuation\">93-df-valuation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\mathcal L^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span> provide the explicitly tagged implication-negation syntax of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e3c8f5c9e577b791\" href=\"?note=e3c8f5c9e577b791\" title=\"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus\">93-df-classical-propositional-calculus</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ded}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ded}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}_{93}\\)</span> have their source signatures.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The Łukasiewicz axiom set, calculus, proof-induced relation, logic, standard real truth-operation graphs and their family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LukStdOpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{LukStdOpFam}_{93}\\)</span>, standard-validity predicate, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LukPres}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LukPres}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>；原一元辅助函数仍以载集元素为自变量，运算族中的解释以单元组为自变量。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}^{\\mathsf{L}_{\\infty}}_{93}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi)):\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\Bigl\\{\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi,\\chi),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\\chi))\\bigr):\n\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\Bigl\\{\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi),\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi)),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi)\\bigr):\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\Bigl\\{\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\psi),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi),\\varphi)\\bigr):\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}^{\\mathsf{L}_{\\infty}}_{93}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi)):\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\Bigl\\{\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi,\\chi),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\\chi))\\bigr):\n\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\Bigl\\{\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi),\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi)),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi)\\bigr):\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\Bigl\\{\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\psi),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi),\\varphi)\\bigr):\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\langle F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\mathrm{Ax}^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93},\n\\{R^{\\mathsf{MP}}_{93}\\}\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\langle F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\mathrm{Ax}^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93},\n\\{R^{\\mathsf{MP}}_{93}\\}\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\vdash^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\n\\mathcal P(F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\times F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}:\n\\mathrm{Ded}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\mathcal P^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93})\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\vdash^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\n\\mathcal P(F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\times F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}:\n\\mathrm{Ded}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\mathcal P^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93})\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathsf L^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\langle F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\vdash^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathsf L^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\langle F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\vdash^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{[0,1]}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\min\\{1,1-x+y\\}\\rangle:x,y\\in[0,1]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{[0,1]}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,1-x\\rangle:x\\in[0,1]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LukStdOpFam}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\operatorname{Imp}^{[0,1]}_{93}\\rangle,\n\\langle\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}(\\operatorname{Neg}^{[0,1]}_{93};[0,1])\\rangle\n\\right\\},\\\\\n[0,1]^{\\to,\\neg}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle[0,1],\n\\operatorname{LukStdOpFam}_{93}\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})^{[0,1]^{\\to,\\neg}_{93}}\n&amp;=\\operatorname{Imp}^{[0,1]}_{93},\n\\qquad\n(\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})^{[0,1]^{\\to,\\neg}_{93}}\n=\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}(\\operatorname{Neg}^{[0,1]}_{93};[0,1]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{[0,1]}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\min\\{1,1-x+y\\}\\rangle:x,y\\in[0,1]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{[0,1]}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,1-x\\rangle:x\\in[0,1]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LukStdOpFam}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\operatorname{Imp}^{[0,1]}_{93}\\rangle,\n\\langle\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}(\\operatorname{Neg}^{[0,1]}_{93};[0,1])\\rangle\n\\right\\},\\\\\n[0,1]^{\\to,\\neg}_{93}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle[0,1],\n\\operatorname{LukStdOpFam}_{93}\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\mathtt{imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})^{[0,1]^{\\to,\\neg}_{93}}\n&amp;=\\operatorname{Imp}^{[0,1]}_{93},\n\\qquad\n(\\mathtt{neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})^{[0,1]^{\\to,\\neg}_{93}}\n=\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}(\\operatorname{Neg}^{[0,1]}_{93};[0,1]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}}([0,1]^{\\to,\\neg}_{93})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}}([0,1]^{\\to,\\neg}_{93})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\models^{[0,1]}_{93}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\varphi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Val}_{93}(v,\\mathcal L^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},[0,1]^{\\to,\\neg}_{93})\n\\to v(\\varphi)=1\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\models^{[0,1]}_{93}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\varphi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Val}_{93}(v,\\mathcal L^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},[0,1]^{\\to,\\neg}_{93})\n\\to v(\\varphi)=1\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LukPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal P=\\mathcal P^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}\n\\land\\mathsf L=\\mathsf L^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}}\n(F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\vdash^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LukPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal P=\\mathcal P^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}\n\\land\\mathsf L=\\mathsf L^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}}\n(F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93},\\vdash^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LukPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93},\n\\mathsf L^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lukasiewicz\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LukPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93},\n\\mathsf L^{\\mathsf L_{\\infty}}_{93})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The syntax is the explicitly tagged implication-negation language shared with the classical comparison calculus, but the fourth axiom and the standard truth algebra are Łukasiewicz-specific. Only theoremhood validity in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span> is defined here; no strong-completeness claim for arbitrary infinite premise sets is built into the presentation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"9